# Binary files stay byte for byte on every checkout. Without this, Git on
# Windows (the Windows app's CI runner) treated a PDF test fixture as text and
# rewrote its line endings, and four PDF tests failed there only (18 Oct).
*.pdf  binary
*.png  binary
*.webp binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.jar  binary
*.jks  binary
*.keystore binary
*.zip  binary
*.msi  binary
*.glb  binary
*.ktx  binary
*.filamat binary
# The shell scripts CI runs must keep Unix line endings on any machine.
*.sh   text eol=lf
